# harness to reliably observe every window, this repo's shared scenario
# harness included; see `w46-block-stop.jvm.test.ts`'s own header). Seat 1
# (ai, the DEFENDER) holds ONE untapped, non-sick creature able to block and
# NOTHING ELSE — no hand, no untapped non-land permanent, nothing a payment
# window could offer.
